read: app:doctrine-prophecy~7922 | They Came Out of Great Tribulation
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~7896 | The Secret Pre-Trib Rapture Is Heresy
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~9728 | Not imminent: the signs before His return

=== The Antichrist and the beast
# from 7893, 8099, 16074
--- The rider on the white horse
kicker: The Antichrist
big: Revelation 6:2 | mark: he went forth conquering, and to conquer
p: A man who goes forth conquering comes to prominence. He brings an offer of peace and safety. He is fatally wounded and then restored to life by Satan, likely possessed. A counterfeit Christ, riding a white horse, so as to fool everyone ([[Revelation 13:3]]).
p: Antiochus IV Epiphanes is the type ([[Daniel 11:31]]). The man of sin will make a treaty with many, bring in a new world order, enter Jerusalem, and betray the Jews who likely helped him rise to power, the days of vengeance.

# from 8100, 8101, 16537, 2680
--- The mark of the beast
kicker: The Antichrist
big: Revelation 13:16-17 | mark: that no man might buy or sell, save he that had the mark
p: The false prophet makes a one world religion that worships the antichrist. ALL whose names are not in the Book of Life will worship the beast. With digital currency and subdermal chips, we can imagine how this system would work ([[Revelation 13:8]]).
p: No one who is saved will worship the beast to take his mark. No person who takes the mark will repent and be saved. Reprobates ([[Revelation 14:9-11]]). The image of the beast that speaks may be some form of self-aware AI.

# from 16046, 8104, 11915, 8058
--- Daniel and the Revelation
kicker: The Antichrist
big: Daniel 2:44 | mark: the God of heaven set up a kingdom, which shall never be destroyed
p: The feet of iron and miry clay represent where we have been for the past 2000 years, a vestige of Rome that still clings to power. From its 10 kingdoms the beast will be given power for the final one world government.
p: End-times Babylon is not Jerusalem ([[Revelation 16:19]]). The woman of Revelation 12 is allegorical Eve, not Mary and not the modern state calling itself Israel.
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~8099 | The Beast Promises Peace and Safety
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~8101 | The Mark of the Beast

=== The day of His wrath
# from 7945, 7946, 8222
--- The trumpets and the vials
kicker: The day of His wrath
big: Revelation 8:6 | mark: the seven angels which had the seven trumpets prepared themselves to sound
p: The trumpets are God's wrath, fueled by the prayers of the saints. It cannot be confused with the tribulation. The 7 vials align with the 7 trumpets, poured out in the same three and a half years, the second half of Daniel's 70th week ([[Revelation 16:1]]).
p: The 10 plagues of Egypt mirror the judgments poured out during the days of God's wrath. Water to blood, hail, darkness. The exodus is a picture of salvation, and a picture of the end times.

# from 7979, 8155, 15657
--- Yet they repented not
kicker: The day of His wrath
big: Revelation 9:20 | mark: yet repented not of the works of their hands
p: Even in His wrath God seeks repentance. The everlasting gospel is preached even in wrath ([[Revelation 14:6]]). I believe the 144,000 are sent to minister to those few on earth who do repent during this time.
p: The proud and haughty will flee to the mountains and caves and their bunkers and pray for the rocks to cover them, and there will be nowhere left to hide ([[Isaiah 2:19]]; [[Revelation 6:16]]).

# from 8303, 16650, 8165
--- Armageddon
kicker: The day of His wrath
big: Revelation 19:20 | mark: These both were cast alive into a lake of fire burning with brimstone
p: Jesus returns with His saints, and splits the mount of Olives in two ([[Zechariah 14:4]]). The armies of the beast assemble to battle Jesus. The antichrist and his false prophet are instantly cast into the lake of fire. The rest slain by the sword that comes from the mouth of Christ, the word of God.
p: The blood of innocents cries out for vengeance, and the grapes of wrath are trodden in the winepress ([[Revelation 14:19-20]]).
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~7945 | The Trumpets Are Wrath, Not Tribulation
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~8303 | The battle of Armageddon

=== Gog, Magog and Ezekiel's temple
# from 16390, 16391, 16392, 16401
--- Gog and Magog
kicker: Gog and Magog
big: Revelation 20:7-8 | mark: Satan shall be loosed out of his prison; to gather them together to battle
p: Ezekiel 38 and Revelation 20 are the same prophecy, describing the same future event: the armies of the world at the end of the millennium. From the 1940s on, Gog and Magog were mapped onto every generation's enemies: Nazi Germany, the Soviet Union, China.
p: Dispensational Zionism had to confuse the timing of every event on God's prophetic calendar to make whoever the Jews were against into the armies of the beast. Don't break fellowship over prophecy timing.

# from 16446, 16443, 16432, 16426, 16421
--- Ezekiel's temple
kicker: Ezekiel's temple
big: Ezekiel 43:10 | mark: that they may be ashamed of their iniquities
p: A promise contingent on their getting right. An end-times that will now never be, God graciously offering Israel, one last time.
p: The dispensationalists would have us believe that in the millennium, temple sacrifice returns. Any third temple would not have God's blessing. Jesus IS the Temple. *There's coming a day... God is going to send the Messiah back to rebuild the temple.* – damned viper, John MacArthur.
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~16390 | Gog and Magog are the armies of the world
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~16446 | Ezekiel's temple: the offer that will never be

=== The new heavens and new earth
# from 1572, 13490, 3062
--- The thousand years
kicker: The new heavens and earth
big: Revelation 20:2-3 | mark: bound him a thousand years
p: Post-millennialism and amillennialism are as unbiblical as pre-trib rapture and dispensationalist Zionism. The 1000 years is the time Satan is bound while Christ rules and reigns with the saints. Clearly it isn't now, as Satan is free to deceive ([[1 Peter 5:8]]).
p: Preterism and amillennialism are signs of believing in vain, or of a babe in Christ tossed to and fro. Revelation was written around 96 AD, 25+ years after the destruction of Jerusalem, and Nero wasn't *the* antichrist.

# from 16433, 15991, 12004
--- No temple therein
kicker: The new heavens and earth
big: Revelation 21:22-23 | mark: the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are the temple of it
p: The heavenly Jerusalem has no temple, because the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are the temple. No need for the Sun, because His glory *is* our light. Sacrifice will not be needed, as our sins are remembered no more.
p: *For, behold, I create new heavens and a new earth* ([[Isaiah 65:17]]). The final chapter of Isaiah, like the final book of the Bible, perfectly encapsulates the hope that we have set before us.
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~1572 | The thousand years Satan is bound
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~16433 | No temple in the eternal state

=== Watch
# from 16370, 4384, 9628
--- Not the Late Great Planet Earth
kicker: Watch
big: 2 Timothy 2:17-18 | mark: saying that the resurrection is past already
p: Hal Lindsey suggested the rapture might occur in 1988, 40 years after 1948, and linked the European Economic Community to the ten horns. His book absolutely tainted the discussion, even after his predictions failed.
p: People spend years debating end times prophecy, and yet have no understanding of the basic Gospel of salvation. Much of it is fairly easy to understand, the timing of things most of all, in the Spirit and with the primary doctrines first.

# from 6393, 17964, 17113, 16642
--- Watch ye therefore
kicker: Watch
big: Mark 13:37 | mark: And what I say unto you I say unto all, Watch
p: Watch. Be prepared. Be sober and vigilant. Not carried away by the cares of this world. Not in fear of the tribulation. Be like the virgins who filled their lamps with oil, a servant who increased his master's treasure.
p: The very elect can be deceived, if backsliding and worldly ([[Matthew 24:24]]). The imminent return of Christ is true... after all these things come to pass. Until they do, win souls!
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~6393 | Watch ye therefore
read: app:doctrine-prophecy~17113 | Win souls until the day of Christ

=== Even so, come
--- Even So, Come, Lord Jesus [title]
overline: End times & prophecy
heading: Even So, Come
big: Revelation 22:20 | mark: Even so, come, Lord Jesus
center: The Revelation is not written to obscure. Its intent is literally the title. To reveal.
